rtamento semi mobiliado\n\nCozinha equipada com Geladeira embutida Gorenje e cooktop Crissair\n\n\nAgende sua visita!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7e250472-edc8-40ad-8281-7124d9570652.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/95524898-d3b4-4504-ba9d-9cc8bb0dd309.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/33346dda-0a1f-43ad-b594-cabad08c8bb4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fe253613-857c-454d-9e3c-f741417fd3d6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1a3bd0fa-211e-4277-b10e-1eda3a5671b4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a91eea6b-6755-477b-96fa-f75739eafce7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/54d639d9-4cc8-4d18-9a33-0b7fe7670549.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b86a1ff6-7a89-4f5d-bb03-46a3e7b38166.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d431058-2e3c-4b2e-b509-5642356d8b7c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ad6c0f22-aab3-4750-9caf-9bab36afbfaa.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5aad4cea-4190-4d46-9a26-fdf5c37465ab.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-homes-images-watermark/59904ed8-b52f-4081-912b-d7edf05ea771.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab13a51201cf3271d806420/pilar-h